Package: procular
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.12), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo,
 python3-psutil, gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.12), gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5)
Recommends: pkexec | policykit-1, iproute2
Suggests: pipewire-bin | pulseaudio-utils | alsa-utils
Description: process manager for administrators and developers
 Procular is a process manager for GNOME, inspired by System Informer. It
 shows a live process tree with detailed per-process properties (threads,
 memory regions, open files, sockets, environment), systemd services with
 their journal, network connections, disk activity, exited processes and
 system information for CPU, memory, disks, network interfaces and GPUs.
 .
 Actions on other users' processes go through a small, strictly validated
 helper run with pkexec.
